                <head>Convention between the United States and other powers concerning literary and
                    artistic copyrights</head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at city of Mexico, January 27,
                        1902. Ratification advised by the Senate, January 31, 1908. Ratified by the
                        President, March 16, 1908. Ratification of the United States deposited with
                        the Government of Mexico, March 31, 1908. Proclaimed April 9, 1908.</hi></p>

